{{> head officeStyles=true}}<body class="office">{{> staffNav}}<main id="main" class="office-main">{{> officeFlash}}<header class="page-heading"><div><h1>Planning reports</h1><p>Current nonarchived resources and active employees; budget totals use the selected fiscal year. Resource totals count records rather than adding incompatible units.</p></div></header><section class="panel"><form method="get" class="toolbar"><label>Budget fiscal year<input name="fiscalYear" type="number" min="1900" max="9999" value="{{fiscalYear}}" required></label><button class="button">Apply year</button><a class="button secondary" href="{{csvUrl}}">Export CSV</a><a class="button secondary" href="{{printUrl}}">Print view</a>{{#if print}}<button class="button secondary" type="button" data-print>Print</button>{{/if}}</form><h2>Resource summary</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table class="office-table"><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Resource records</th></tr></thead><tbody>{{#each categories}}<tr><td>{{category}}</td><td>{{count}}</td></tr>{{else}}<tr><td colspan="2">No active resources recorded.</td></tr>{{/each}}</tbody></table></div><p><strong>Active personnel: {{activePersonnel}}</strong></p><p class="small muted">Active employment status, including employees currently assigned. Archived employees are excluded.</p></section><section class="panel"><h2>Department budget · {{fiscalYear}}</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table class="office-table"><thead><tr><th>Department</th><th>Allocated (PHP)</th><th>Spent (PHP)</th><th>Remaining (PHP)</th><th>Used</th><th>Budget status</th></tr></thead><tbody>{{#each departments}}<tr><td>{{department}}</td><td>{{allocatedDisplay}}</td><td>{{spentDisplay}}</td><td>{{remainingDisplay}}</td><td>{{usedDisplay}}</td><td>{{#if overBudget}}Over budget{{else}}Within budget{{/if}}</td></tr>{{else}}<tr><td colspan="6">No budget entries for this fiscal year.</td></tr>{{/each}}</tbody></table></div><p class="small muted">Percentage used is not applicable when allocation is zero. Any spending above zero is marked over budget.</p></section></main>{{> officeFooter}}</body></html>
